### Categories Endpoints

### 1. List all categories
GET http://localhost:8080/categories
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get category by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/categories/FICTION
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create new category
POST http://localhost:8080/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "ROMANCE",
  "name": "Romance",
  "description": "Romantic novels and stories"
}

### 4. Update category (full)
PUT http://localhost:8080/categories/ROMANCE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "ROMANCE",
  "name": "Romance Updated",
  "description": "Updated description for romantic books"
}

### 5. Update category (partial)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/categories/ROMANCE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Only updating the description field"
}

### 6. Delete category
DELETE http://localhost:8080/categories/ROMANCE

### 7. List with pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/categories?page=0&size=2&orderBy=name&direction=ASC
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################

### Authors Endpoints (Long ID)

### 1. List all authors
GET http://localhost:8080/authors
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get author by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/authors/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create new author
POST http://localhost:8080/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "J.K. Rowling",
  "email": "jk@example.com",
  "bio": "British author, best known for Harry Potter series",
  "active": true
}

### 4. Update author (full)
PUT http://localhost:8080/authors/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "J.K. Rowling Updated",
  "email": "jk.rowling@example.com",
  "bio": "Updated biography",
  "active": true
}

### 5. Update author (partial) - only bio
PATCH http://localhost:8080/authors/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Partial update - only changing the bio field"
}

### 6. Delete author (soft delete - sets active=false)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/authors/4

### 7. Filter active authors
GET http://localhost:8080/authors?active=true
Accept: application/json

### 8. Filter by name (case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:8080/authors?name=orwell
Accept: application/json

### 9. Pagination with sorting
GET http://localhost:8080/authors?page=0&size=2&orderBy=name&direction=DESC
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################

### Books Endpoints (UUID + Custom Validations)

### 1. List all books
GET http://localhost:8080/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get book by ID (use a valid UUID from previous GET)
# Replace {uuid} with actual UUID from database
GET http://localhost:8080/books/{uuid}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create new book
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby",
  "isbn": "978-0-7432-7356-5",
  "price": 14.99,
  "pages": 180,
  "publicationDate": "1925-04-10",
  "description": "A classic American novel set in Jazz Age",
  "authorId": 1,
  "categoryId": "FICTION"
}

### 4. Create book with inactive author (should fail with 422)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "isbn": "978-0-1234-5678-9",
  "price": 19.99,
  "pages": 200,
  "publicationDate": "2024-01-01",
  "description": "This should fail if author is inactive",
  "authorId": 999,
  "categoryId": "FICTION"
}

### 5. Update book (full) - replace {uuid}
PUT http://localhost:8080/books/{uuid}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby - Special Edition",
  "isbn": "978-0-7432-7356-5",
  "price": 19.99,
  "pages": 180,
  "publicationDate": "1925-04-10",
  "description": "Updated special edition",
  "authorId": 1,
  "categoryId": "FICTION"
}

### 6. Update book (partial) - only price
PATCH http://localhost:8080/books/{uuid}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 12.99
}

### 7. Delete book (hard delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/books/{uuid}

### 8. Filter by category
GET http://localhost:8080/books?categoryId=FICTION
Accept: application/json

### 9. Filter by title (case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:8080/books?title=foundation
Accept: application/json

### 10. Complex filtering with pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/books?categoryId=FICTION&page=0&size=5&orderBy=title&direction=ASC
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################

### OrderItems Endpoints (Composite Key)

### 1. List all order items
GET http://localhost:8080/order-items
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get order item by composite ID (Base64URL encoded)
# The ID must be Base64URL encoded JSON: {"orderId":"uuid","bookId":"uuid"}
GET http://localhost:8080/order-items/eyJvcmRlcklkIjoiMDBkZTExMTEtMTExMS0xMTExLTExMTEtMTExMTExMTExMTExIiwiYm9va0lkIjoiYjAwYzExMTEtMTExMS0xMTExLTExMTEtMTExMTExMTExMTExIn0
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create new order item
POST http://localhost:8080/order-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "00de1111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "bookId": "b00c2222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "quantity": 3,
  "unitPrice": 12.99
}

### 4. Delete order item
DELETE http://localhost:8080/order-items/eyJvcmRlcklkIjoiMDBkZTExMTEtMTExMS0xMTExLTExMTEtMTExMTExMTExMTExIiwiYm9va0lkIjoiYjAwYzExMTEtMTExMS0xMTExLTExMTEtMTExMTExMTExMTExIn0

###############################################################################

### Validation Examples (should return 400 Bad Request)

### Invalid category - ID too short
POST http://localhost:8080/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "A",
  "name": "Test"
}

### Invalid author - name too short
POST http://localhost:8080/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AB",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Invalid book - missing required fields
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Book"
}

### Invalid book - negative price
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "isbn": "978-0-1234-5678-9",
  "price": -10.00,
  "pages": 100,
  "authorId": 1,
  "categoryId": "FICTION"
}

### Invalid book - invalid email format
POST http://localhost:8080/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Author",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

###############################################################################

### Error Handling Examples

### 404 - Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/authors/99999
Accept: application/json

### 404 - Category not found
GET http://localhost:8080/categories/NONEXISTENT
Accept: application/json

### 422 - Business rule violation (non-existent author)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "isbn": "978-0-1234-5678-9",
  "price": 19.99,
  "pages": 200,
  "publicationDate": "2024-01-01",
  "authorId": 99999,
  "categoryId": "FICTION"
}
